WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.072
Refreshing a materialized view rebuilds the stored result from its underlying query.

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:14.482
In this example, after we create a stale condition, we refresh the materialized view and compare the counts again.

00:00:14.482 --> 00:00:19.992
The stored diagnosis count should now match the current source data, and the refresh time should show when the new

00:00:19.992 --> 00:00:22.907
snapshot was created.
